{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type QueryCacheNotifyEvent =\n  | NotifyEventQueryAdded\n  | NotifyEventQueryRemoved\n  | NotifyEventQueryUpdated\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverAdded\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverRemoved\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverResultsUpdated\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverOptionsUpdated;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queryCache.ts#L85","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/queryCache.ts:85"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The event passed to a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryCache"},{"type":"text","value":" subscriber. Fired whenever a query is added or removed from\nthe cache, its state is updated (e.g. via "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"query.setState"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.removeQueries"},{"type":"text","value":"), or\none of its observers is added, removed, or has its results or options updated."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype QueryCacheNotifyEvent =\n  | NotifyEventQueryAdded\n  | NotifyEventQueryRemoved\n  | NotifyEventQueryUpdated\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverAdded\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverRemoved\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverResultsUpdated\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverOptionsUpdated;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queryCache.ts:85](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queryCache.ts#L85)\n\nThe event passed to a `QueryCache` subscriber. Fired whenever a query is added or removed from\nthe cache, its state is updated (e.g. via `query.setState` or `queryClient.removeQueries`), or\none of its observers is added, removed, or has its results or options updated.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueryCacheNotifyEvent\ntitle: QueryCacheNotifyEvent\n---\n\n```ts\ntype QueryCacheNotifyEvent =\n  | NotifyEventQueryAdded\n  | NotifyEventQueryRemoved\n  | NotifyEventQueryUpdated\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverAdded\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverRemoved\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverResultsUpdated\n  | NotifyEventQueryObserverOptionsUpdated;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queryCache.ts:85](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queryCache.ts#L85)\n\nThe event passed to a `QueryCache` subscriber. Fired whenever a query is added or removed from\nthe cache, its state is updated (e.g. via `query.setState` or `queryClient.removeQueries`), or\none of its observers is added, removed, or has its results or options updated.\n"}
